    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Aga Khan University's Associate Vice Provost and University Librarian, Professor Peter Gatiti, has been elected as the Chairperson for the Kenya Libraries Association (KLA). He was elected during a three-day conference hosted by the country's Library and Information Professionals Association.",
